WEBVTT

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:50.094
A sperm whale takes one breath, and dives.

00:01:50.294 --> 00:01:52.600
Its lungs fold flat under the pressure.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:02:00.304
For most of an hour it hunts in complete darkness, a thousand metres down and more, finding squid by sound alone.

00:02:00.504 --> 00:02:03.725
Its clicks are among the loudest sounds any animal makes.

00:02:03.925 --> 00:02:06.315
Then it turns, and rises to breathe.

